{"track":"python","category":"함수 만들기 ① 기본","level":1,"title":"BMI 계산하기","desc":"<p>몸무게(kg)와 키(m)로 <b>BMI</b> = 몸무게 ÷ 키²를 구해 <b>소수 첫째 자리까지 반올림</b>해 돌려주는 함수 <code>bmi(weight_kg, height_m)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def bmi(weight_kg, height_m):\n    pass\n","solution":"def bmi(weight_kg, height_m):\n    return round(weight_kg / (height_m ** 2), 1)\n","hint":"<p><code>round(값, 1)</code> 로 소수 첫째 자리까지 반올림해요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"bmi(70, 1.75)","expected":22.9,"visible":true},{"call":"bmi(50, 1.6)","expected":19.5,"visible":true},{"call":"bmi(90, 1.8)","expected":27.8,"visible":false},{"call":"bmi(60, 1.7)","expected":20.8,"visible":false}],"id":"py-304"}